The tests cover the flushed count line, the read deadline, and `embeddings_after >= embeddings_after_ingest - removed_orphans`. The synthetic section calls `reproduce` with a 4KB threshold. The live branches call the same function on a fresh copy of `baseline.duckdb` with the default threshold. Step 4 then stops describing a second protocol.

